  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3af485d4-e099-44a2-914c-35b62e2d38f6.png\" style=\"width: 340px; height: 278px;\" /></p><p>Current flowing through both capacitors will be zero at steady state.</p><p>The potential difference across capacitor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will be the sum of the potential difference across the resistor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;and the galvanometer resistance. Mathematically,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8486;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly, the potential difference across capacitor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will be the sum of the potential difference across the resistor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;and the galvanometer resistance. Mathematically,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8486;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Divide equation (1) by equation (2) to obtain the required ratio.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>i</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8486;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8486;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
